OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh government does not want new
OL,4,Anorthern national park, minister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a new national park in north
OL,7,FWales are likely to be shelved after a
OL,8,Fgovernment minister told the Senedd he
OL,9,Fdid not want it to go ahead.
OL,11,FConstitutional Minister Dafydd Trystan
OL,12,FDavies said the Welsh government could
OL,13,Fachieve its environmental objectives
OL,14,Fthrough other means, without the
OL,15,Festimated #11m cost of establishing the
OL,16,Fproposed GlyndE5r National Park.
OL,18,FThe national park had been proposed to
OL,19,Fcover the Clwydian Range and Dee Valley
OL,20,Fand would have been the first new
OL,21,Fnational park in Wales since 1957.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
