OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh government does not want new
OL,4,Anorthern national park, minister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision was welcomed by Reform UK
OL,7,FWales and the Welsh Conservatives, but
OL,8,Fa Welsh Labour Member of the Senedd
OL,9,F(MS) accused Davies of a "lack of
OL,10,Fambition" in axing the scheme.
